# sdist of positnp: the library only. Tests, examples, notebooks, the packaging and board scripts of the
# repository and the bitstreams (separate positnp-kv260* packages) stay out.
include README.pypi.md LICENSE
prune tests
prune examples
prune notebooks
prune packaging
prune scripts
prune positnp/overlays
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod]
